&"character": "Edouard",
&"id": "111",
&"next_id": "112",
&"text": "Edouard's has some psychic abilities and is able to sense which agent is closest to the suspect. However, his own sense of direction is, shall we say, lacking. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\") and GlobalVars.agent_name.size() < 5]Would you like to add Edouard to the team?[/if] [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\") and GlobalVars.agent_name.size() == 5]Your team is full. If you want to add Edouard you must first remove someone.[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\")]Edouard is already selected. Would you like remove Edouard?[/if]",
